Subject: Authority Notice Projection Contract V1
Date: 2026-05-26
Contract UUID: 9153d01d-72fa-4746-a59d-d0ce980da881

@ [slice_surface] docs/slices/FSC4_Final_Slices.v1.sop
@ [surface_boundary] docs/surfaces/FSC4_Surface_Boundary_And_Invariant_Map.v1.sop
@ [runtime_graph_proof_pack] docs/planning/FSC3_Runtime_Graph_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
@ [completion_gate_contract] docs/operators/Completion_Review_Delta_Gate_Contract.v1.sop
@ [interrupt_contract] docs/runtime/SOP_First_Interrupt_Resume_Contract.v1.sop
@ [trace_proof_contract] docs/runtime/Operator_Trace_Runtime_Proof_Contract.v1.sop

& [AuthorityNoticeProjectionContractV1] is the FSC4 contract for projection records, authority notices, freshness, state visibility, and mutation routing
  + [contract_id] is authority-notice-projection-contract-v1
  + [contract_uuid] is 9153d01d-72fa-4746-a59d-d0ce980da881
  + [slice_id] is FSC4-S02
  + [authority_scope] is projection record schema, authority_notice contract, freshness display rule, state visibility rule, mutation-through-operator rule, and projection refusal contract
  + [implementation_scope] is projection contract only
  + [boundary_dependency] is docs/surfaces/FSC4_Surface_Boundary_And_Invariant_Map.v1.sop

  = must: define the record shape every FSC4 projection contract consumes
  = must: expose authority and freshness before projected state can be used for decisions
  = must: route authority-sensitive actions through accepted operators, SOP-first interrupts, coordination review, human override, or completion review gates
  - never: implement UI components, adapters, transports, Langflow export, runtime code, or operations control in this contract

& [ProjectionRecordSchema] is the common record shape for projected surface records
  + [required_field] is projection_id
  + [required_field] is projection_kind
  + [required_field] is projected_subject_ref
  + [required_field] is source_record_ref_set
  + [required_field] is lineage_edge_set
  + [required_field] is authority_notice_ref
  + [required_field] is freshness_rule_ref
  + [required_field] is freshness_state
  + [required_field] is projected_status
  + [required_field] is carrier_surface
  + [required_field] is generated_at
  + [required_field] is invalidation_ref_set
  + [required_field] is supported_action_route_set
  + [required_field] is forbidden_action_set
  + [required_field] is mutation_boundary_ref
  + [projection_kind] is manager_summary_projection
  + [projection_kind] is worker_packet_projection
  + [projection_kind] is narrative_projection
  + [projection_kind] is debug_trace_projection
  + [projection_kind] is conversation_projection
  + [projection_kind] is adapter_event_projection
  + [projection_kind] is langflow_graph_projection

  = must: preserve source_ref_set and lineage_edge_set from the projected authority-bearing records
  = must: keep generated projection identity distinct from source record identity

& [AuthorityNoticeContract] is the authority notice contract for decision-making projections
  + [required_field] is authority_notice_id
  + [required_field] is notice_subject_ref
  + [required_field] is projected_authority_state
  + [required_field] is source_authority_ref_set
  + [required_field] is derived_from_ref_set
  + [required_field] is freshness_state
  + [required_field] is trust_limit
  + [required_field] is permitted_action_set
  + [required_field] is forbidden_action_set
  + [required_field] is required_route_set
  + [required_field] is risk_reason
  + [notice_required_when] is projection may influence human or agent decisions
  + [notice_required_when] is projected state is derived, staleable, stale, ambiguous, blocked, faulted, interrupted, contested, pending review, or lower authority than the invited action
  + [notice_required_when] is carrier surface accepts user or agent input
  + [notice_required_when] is adapter output could be mistaken for accepted proof or completion
  + [notice_required_when] is Langflow projection displays executable-looking graph structure

  = must: make authority limits visible before action selection
  = must: reject projections that omit required authority notices

& [FreshnessDisplayRule] is the freshness rule for projected records
  + [freshness_state] is fresh
  + [freshness_state] is stale
  + [freshness_state] is unknown
  + [freshness_state] is contested
  + [freshness_state] is interrupted
  + [freshness_state] is blocked
  + [freshness_state] is faulted
  + [freshness_state] is pending_review
  + [freshness_input] is source_record_ref_set
  + [freshness_input] is lineage_edge_set
  + [freshness_input] is accepted_boundary_pack_hash
  + [freshness_input] is operator_trace_ref_set
  + [freshness_input] is completion_review_ref
  + [freshness_input] is coordination_claim_ref_set
  + [freshness_input] is interrupt_context_ref
  + [freshness_input] is invalidation_ref_set

  = must: display non-fresh states before actions that depend on fresh authority
  = must: force stale or unknown when source freshness cannot be proven from accepted records

& [StateVisibilityRule] is the rule for blocked, stale, faulted, interrupted, contested, and pending-review projections
  + [visible_state] is blocked
  + [visible_state] is stale
  + [visible_state] is faulted
  + [visible_state] is interrupted
  + [visible_state] is contested
  + [visible_state] is pending_review
  + [visible_state] is unsupported_scope
  + [visible_state] is hidden_write_prevented
  + [display_obligation] is blocker_ref_set
  + [display_obligation] is required_resolution
  + [display_obligation] is stale_source_ref_set
  + [display_obligation] is fault_record_ref
  + [display_obligation] is interrupt_context_ref
  + [display_obligation] is coordination_claim_ref_set
  + [display_obligation] is completion_review_ref

  = must: prevent blocked, stale, faulted, interrupted, contested, or pending-review state from rendering as completed work
  = must: preserve enough visible context for another user, agent, or conversation to understand the stop condition

& [MutationThroughOperatorRule] is the mutation route contract for actions initiated from projections
  + [action_kind] is observe
  + [action_kind] is comment
  + [action_kind] is propose
  + [action_kind] is request_work_packet
  + [action_kind] is request_claim
  + [action_kind] is request_interrupt_resolution
  + [action_kind] is request_human_override
  + [action_kind] is request_completion_review
  + [authority_sensitive_action] is request_work_packet
  + [authority_sensitive_action] is request_claim
  + [authority_sensitive_action] is request_interrupt_resolution
  + [authority_sensitive_action] is request_human_override
  + [authority_sensitive_action] is request_completion_review
  + [allowed_route] is accepted operator contract
  + [allowed_route] is SOP-first interrupt
  + [allowed_route] is coordination review
  + [allowed_route] is explicit human override record with authority_notice
  + [allowed_route] is completion_review_delta_gate
  + [blocked_route] is direct canonical specification write
  + [blocked_route] is direct accepted pack write
  + [blocked_route] is direct completion review acceptance
  + [blocked_route] is direct source authority mutation
  + [blocked_route] is direct operations command

  = must: emit a traceable action request or interrupt context instead of mutating source authority directly
  = must: classify unsupported or ambiguous actions as interrupted rather than successful

& [ProjectionRefusalContract] is the refusal contract for unsafe projection states
  + [refusal_reason] is missing_source_ref_set
  + [refusal_reason] is missing_lineage_edge_set
  + [refusal_reason] is missing_authority_notice
  + [refusal_reason] is missing_freshness_rule
  + [refusal_reason] is hidden_blocked_state
  + [refusal_reason] is hidden_fault_state
  + [refusal_reason] is hidden_interrupt_state
  + [refusal_reason] is unsupported_action_route
  + [refusal_output] is projection_fault_record
  + [refusal_output] is stale_projection
  + [refusal_output] is blocked_projection
  + [refusal_output] is sop_first_interrupt_context

  = must: refuse unsafe projection rather than showing a misleading usable surface
  = must: preserve enough evidence for completion review and downstream fixture planning

& [AuthorityNoticeProjectionCoverageReview] is the FSC4-S02 coverage checklist
  + [projection_record_schema_present] is ProjectionRecordSchema
  + [authority_notice_contract_present] is AuthorityNoticeContract
  + [freshness_display_rule_present] is FreshnessDisplayRule
  + [state_visibility_rule_present] is StateVisibilityRule
  + [mutation_through_operator_rule_present] is MutationThroughOperatorRule
  + [projection_refusal_contract_present] is ProjectionRefusalContract
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is UI implementation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is adapter implementation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is transport implementation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is Langflow export implementation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is runtime implementation
  + [forbidden_scope_absent] is operations control

  = must: reject FSC4-S02 if projections can hide authority, freshness, blocked, stale, faulted, interrupted, contested, or pending-review state
  = must: open FSC4-S03 only after this contract is accepted by completion review
